---
import { challenges } from '../../data/portfolio.js';
---
<section class="slide challenge-slide" id="challenge" data-section>
  <div class="slide-inner challenge-grid-layout">
    <aside class="dark-story challenge-story"><div class="eyebrow light"><i></i>THE CHALLENGE</div><h2>Complex enterprise products rarely have a <span>single problem.</span></h2><p>The hard part is coordination: multiple stakeholders, systems, data sources, business rules, exceptions, regulatory requirements and operational hand-offs have to behave as one product experience.</p><div class="check-list"><span>Frame the problem before solution design</span><span>Make dependencies and trade-offs visible</span><span>Translate complexity into product behavior</span><span>Design for controls, scale and adoption</span><span>Measure outcomes, not activity alone</span></div></aside>
    <div class="challenge-area"><div class="challenge-center"><div class="center-ring"></div><strong>PROBLEM<br/>FRAMING</strong><small>BEFORE SOLUTION DESIGN</small></div>{challenges.map(([n,title,text],i) => <article class={`challenge-card c${i+1}`}><b>{n}</b><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><div class="progress"><span class="active">Frame</span><span>Design</span><span>Deliver</span><span>Measure</span></div></article>)}</div>
  </div>
</section>
